=2 Walkthrough
* You must wait a game day after completing {q:Flowers for Svenja|Flowers for Svenja|Flowers for Svenja} before you may flag this quest.
* Check the door to {n:Svenja's Manor|Door: Svenja's Manor} at (I-8) in {z:Western Adoulin} (Closest to the Courier's Coalition Waypoint).
* Next, check the door ("to the left" as if you were exiting the manor) to the Hospital at (I-9) in {z:Western Adoulin}.
* Speak to {n:Borghest} at the {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} {p:Frontier Station}.
* Obtain a piece of {i:Urunday Lumber|Urunday Lumber|3927}, a {i:Damascus Ingot|Damascus Ingot|658}, and a {i:Fire Crystal|Fire Crystal|4096}.
* Trade the items to {n:Chanteillie} at the {p:Inventors' Coalition} to receive the {k:Inventors' Coalition pickaxe} key item.
** {n:Chanteillie} will not take the items if she is waiting for the items for the quest {q:Vegetable Vegetable Crisis|Vegetable Vegetable Crisis|Vegetable Vegetable Crisis}.
* Head back to the Hospital to complete the quest.

